    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Project Management Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this bot to stay organized and manage your Explore-Style App project. It can help you plan next steps, clarify requirements from the guide or rubric, and create a realistic schedule for finishing your work.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n>I’m not sure what to work on next for my Explore-Style App project. Can you help me make a plan based on the guide and rubric?\r\n\r\n>I have the following ideas of things to work on next for my project: [insert list here]. Can you help me prioritize these?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
